# Garenbrig Growth {G} (CR 715.3, 601.2c): "Return target creature or land card from your graveyard to your hand" has no legal target
# when the graveyard holds only a Mox Sapphire and a Mox Pearl (artifacts) and the Faithless Looting just cast (a sorcery): the
# Adventure cannot be cast, at any of them, and Virtue of Strength stays in hand to be cast as the enchantment.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Virtue of Strength
Faithless Looting
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Forest
Forest
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Mox Sapphire; Mox Pearl)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Virtue of Strength.Cast(Ability: Garenbrig Growth)
! Bot1.Hand.Virtue of Strength.Cast(Ability: Garenbrig Growth; Bot1.Graveyard.Faithless Looting)
! Bot1.Hand.Virtue of Strength.Cast(Ability: Garenbrig Growth; Bot1.Graveyard.Mox Sapphire)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Forest; Forest; Virtue of Strength
